.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_MIPS_ABIFLAGS 3
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_mips_abiflags
.Nd read MIPS ABI flags from an ELF object
.Sh LIBRARY
.Lb libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft int
.Fn elf_mips_abiflags "const elfobj_t *obj" "elf_mips_abiflags_t *out"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn elf_mips_abiflags
function locates and decodes MIPS ABI flags from
.Fa obj .
It accepts either a section of type
.Dv SHT_MIPS_ABIFLAGS
or a section named
.Pa .MIPS.abiflags .
.Pp
On success,
.Fa out
is filled with the decoded values:
version, ISA level and revision, GPR/FPR/CPR sizes, floating-point ABI,
ISA extension bits, ASE bits, and flags words.
.Pp
The section payload must contain at least 24 bytes in the object endianness.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The
.Fn elf_mips_abiflags
function returns 1 on success.
It returns 0 if
.Fa obj
or
.Fa out
is
.Dv NULL ,
if no ABI flags section is present,
or if the section is malformed or too short.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_init_mips32 3 ,
.Xr elf_init_mips64 3 ,
.Xr elfobj 3
